---
interface Props { intro: string; several?: boolean }
const { intro, several = true } = Astro.props;
---
<h2 id="s-monthly" data-toc="Month by month">Month by month</h2>
<p class="dim">{intro} Hatching marks streams whose chat can't be read, because they're members-only, age-restricted or have no chat replay. A full hatched column means none of that month's chat could be read, and a thin band along the top means some of it couldn't. Hover a month to see which streams.</p>
<div class="mtools">
  {several && <label class="small"><input type="checkbox" id="indep"> Give each channel its own scale</label>}
  <span class="small" id="mnote"></span>
</div>
<div class="multiples" id="multiples"></div>
